flowchart TD
    A["Input kernel directory<br/>C/C++ source + headers + kernel_info.txt"] --> B

    B["Parse MailoHLS action contract<br/>• top function<br/>• Lk loop actions<br/>• Lk array actions<br/>• expected dimensions/bounds"] --> C

    C{"Does every kernel_info action<br/>have an exact labeled source location?"}
    C -- No --> X1["Fail generation<br/>Do not guess action order"]
    C -- Yes --> D

    D["Build action manifest<br/>action ID, kind, function,<br/>file, line, column, dimensions"] --> E

    E["Run Polygeist / cgeist<br/>-O0, full-rank MemRefs,<br/>debug source locations,<br/>helper functions not inlined"] --> F

    F["Raise eligible SCF loops/accesses to Affine<br/>Keep unsupported dynamic control as SCF"] --> G

    G{"Does MLIR verify?"}
    G -- No --> X2["Fail and report frontend error"]
    G -- Yes --> H

    H["Run native MLIR analysis<br/>• memory effects<br/>• view relations<br/>• alias classes<br/>• affine dependence<br/>• affine trip counts"] --> I

    I{"Native schema complete,<br/>ordered and unchanged?"}
    I -- No --> X3["Fail: analysis is not trusted"]
    I -- Yes --> J

    J["Phase 1 — Discover all functions<br/>Create complete symbol table<br/>before processing call sites"] --> K

    K["Phase 2 — Index functions, regions and blocks<br/>Create operation nodes and block scopes"] --> L

    L["Create one node per SSA value<br/>Classify as:<br/>• operation result<br/>• block argument"] --> M

    M["Add native SSA def–use edges<br/>Preserve operand/result positions and types"] --> N

    N["Resolve all loop actions by source location<br/>Check one-to-one action ↔ loop mapping"] --> O

    O["Annotate loops<br/>• bounds<br/>• step<br/>• native trip count<br/>• nesting depth<br/>• action ID"] --> P

    P["Add structural relations<br/>• region containment<br/>• block adjacency<br/>• direct loop hierarchy<br/>• loop-carried values<br/>• call edges"] --> Q

    Q["Build memory model<br/>• physical roots<br/>• views/casts<br/>• actual ↔ formal aliasing<br/>• read/write accesses"] --> R

    R{"Dependence result?"}
    R -- Proven dependence --> R1["Add RAW/WAR/WAW edge<br/>with distance and loop-carried metadata"]
    R -- Proven independence --> R2["Record independence<br/>do not add dependence edge"]
    R -- Unknown --> R3["Add explicitly conservative relation<br/>or retain root-mediated uncertainty"]
    R1 --> S
    R2 --> S
    R3 --> S

    S["Attach MailoHLS actions<br/>• PIPELINE/UNROLL → loop scope<br/>• ARRAY_PARTITION → memory root and accesses"] --> T

    T{"Did every expected Lk map<br/>exactly once?"}
    T -- No --> X4["Fail generation"]
    T -- Yes --> U

    U["Validate graph contract<br/>node types, flow types,<br/>action coverage, native-analysis coverage"] --> V

    V["Canonicalize nodes and parallel edges<br/>Stable IDs + deterministic ordering"] --> W

    W["Store provenance metadata<br/>source/tool/generator/MLIR/binding hashes"] --> Y

    Y["Write final deterministic<br/>NetworkX MultiDiGraph → GEXF"]